## 2. Modelagem e Arquitetura Técnica

### 2.1 Diagrama de Entidades (ERD)

```mermaid
erDiagram
    users ||--o{ user_organization : "N:N"
    users ||--o{ invites : "inviter"
    users ||--o{ invites : "invitee"
    organizations ||--o{ user_organization : "N:N"
    organizations ||--o{ invites : "org"
    organizations ||--o{ school_classes : "owns"
    organizations ||--o{ subscriptions : "has"
    school_classes ||--o{ class_student : "N:N students"
    school_classes ||--o{ class_teacher : "N:N teachers"
    school_classes ||--o{ class_ownership_logs : "history"
    plans ||--o{ plan_limits : "has"
    plans ||--o{ plan_features : "has"
    plans ||--o{ subscriptions : "plan"
    organizations ||--o{ institution_roles : "has"
    institution_roles ||--o{ institution_role_permissions : "has"
```

### 2.2 Novas Tabelas / Alterações

#### [ALTER] [users](file:///d:/.dev/avaliation_on/platform/app/Models/Organization.php#35-40)
```sql
ALTER TABLE users ADD COLUMN link_code CHAR(8) UNIQUE;
-- Gerar para existentes: UPDATE users SET link_code = generateUniqueCode()
```

#### [ALTER] [invites](file:///d:/.dev/avaliation_on/platform/app/Models/Organization.php#65-69)
```sql
ALTER TABLE invites ADD COLUMN invite_type ENUM('org_teacher','org_student','class_enrollment','class_ownership_transfer') DEFAULT 'org_teacher';
ALTER TABLE invites ADD COLUMN invitee_user_id BIGINT UNSIGNED NULL;
ALTER TABLE invites ADD COLUMN target_entity_type VARCHAR(50) NULL;
ALTER TABLE invites ADD COLUMN target_entity_id BIGINT UNSIGNED NULL;
ALTER TABLE invites MODIFY COLUMN status ENUM('pending','accepted','declined','canceled','expired') DEFAULT 'pending';
-- target_entity: para convites de turma, aponta para school_class
```

#### [ALTER] `school_classes`
```sql
ALTER TABLE school_classes ADD COLUMN owner_type VARCHAR(50) DEFAULT 'organization';
ALTER TABLE school_classes ADD COLUMN owner_id BIGINT UNSIGNED NULL;
-- owner_type: 'organization' | 'user' (professor)
```

#### [NEW] `class_teacher`
```sql
CREATE TABLE class_teacher (
    id BIGINT PRIMARY KEY AUTO_INCREMENT,
    school_class_id BIGINT UNSIGNED NOT NULL,
    user_id BIGINT UNSIGNED NOT NULL,
    assigned_at TIMESTAMP DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,
    UNIQUE(school_class_id, user_id)
);
```

#### [NEW] `class_ownership_logs`
```sql
CREATE TABLE class_ownership_logs (
    id BIGINT PRIMARY KEY AUTO_INCREMENT,
    school_class_id BIGINT UNSIGNED NOT NULL,
    previous_owner_type VARCHAR(50),
    previous_owner_id BIGINT UNSIGNED,
    new_owner_type VARCHAR(50),
    new_owner_id BIGINT UNSIGNED,
    initiated_by BIGINT UNSIGNED NOT NULL,
    transferred_at TIMESTAMP DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP
);
```

#### [NEW] `institution_roles`
```sql
CREATE TABLE institution_roles (
    id BIGINT PRIMARY KEY AUTO_INCREMENT,
    organization_id BIGINT UNSIGNED NOT NULL,
    name VARCHAR(100) NOT NULL,       -- Coordenador, Pedagogo
    slug VARCHAR(100) NOT NULL,
    description TEXT NULL,
    is_active BOOLEAN DEFAULT TRUE,
    created_at TIMESTAMP, updated_at TIMESTAMP,
    UNIQUE(organization_id, slug)
);
```

#### [NEW] `institution_role_permissions`
```sql
CREATE TABLE institution_role_permissions (
    id BIGINT PRIMARY KEY AUTO_INCREMENT,
    institution_role_id BIGINT UNSIGNED NOT NULL,
    permission VARCHAR(100) NOT NULL,  -- 'manage_teachers', 'view_reports', etc.
    UNIQUE(institution_role_id, permission)
);
```

#### [ALTER] `user_organization`
```sql
ALTER TABLE user_organization ADD COLUMN institution_role_id BIGINT UNSIGNED NULL;
-- Para perfis extras: role_in_org='staff' + institution_role_id aponta para o cargo
```

#### [ALTER] [organizations](file:///d:/.dev/avaliation_on/platform/app/Models/User.php#46-54)
```sql
ALTER TABLE organizations ADD COLUMN can_access_trash BOOLEAN DEFAULT FALSE;
ALTER TABLE organizations ADD COLUMN can_access_logs BOOLEAN DEFAULT FALSE;
```

### 2.3 Serviços de Domínio

```mermaid
graph TD
    A["TeacherController / StudentController"] --> B["UserFinderService"]
    B -->|novo| C["UserCreatorService"]
    B -->|existente| D["InviteManagerService v2"]
    D --> E["UserLinkerService v2"]
    E --> F["EffectivePlanResolver"]
    
    G["ClassController"] --> H["ClassOwnershipService"]
    H --> D
    
    I["BillingController"] --> J["SubscriptionService"]
    
    K["InstitutionRoleService"] --> L["PermissionResolver"]
```

| Service | Responsabilidade |
|---------|-----------------|
| `UserFinderService` | Busca por email/código. Retorna `{found: bool, user?: User, suggestion: 'create'\|'invite'}` |
| `UserCreatorService` | Cria usuário novo (com senha, link_code, role, org_id) |
| [InviteManagerService](file:///d:/.dev/avaliation_on/platform/app/Services/InviteManagerService.php#11-116) (v2) | Envia convites de todos os tipos (org, turma, transferência). Valida limites e duplicatas |
| [UserLinkerService](file:///d:/.dev/avaliation_on/platform/app/Services/UserLinkerService.php#10-119) (v2) | Aceita/recusa convites. Lida com vínculo org, enrollment em turma e transferência |
| `ClassOwnershipService` | Inicia transferência, verifica capacidade do destinatário, processa aceite |
| `InstitutionRoleService` | CRUD de cargos/permissões extras no escopo da org |
| `SubscriptionService` | Troca de plano, cancelamento, status da assinatura |
| `AccessGateService` | Valida acesso a trash/logs (verifica `can_access_*` na org) |

### 2.4 Estratégia de Convites/Aceite

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant Inst as Instituição
    participant Sys as Sistema
    participant Prof as Professor

    Inst->>Sys: Buscar professor (email/código)
    Sys-->>Inst: "Professor encontrado. Enviar convite?"
    Inst->>Sys: Enviar convite (invite_type=org_teacher)
    Sys->>Prof: Notificação (email + inbox interno)
    Prof->>Sys: Aceitar convite
    Sys->>Sys: DB::transaction { invite.accept(), pivot.create(), cache.purge() }
    Sys-->>Prof: "Vínculo ativo com [Instituição]"
    Sys-->>Inst: "Professor [nome] vinculado!"
```

### 2.5 Estratégia de Transferência de Turma

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant Owner as Proprietário
    participant Sys as Sistema
    participant Dest as Destinatário

    Owner->>Sys: Iniciar transferência (turma → destinatário)
    Sys->>Sys: Verificar capacidade do destinatário (plano)
    Sys->>Dest: Convite de transferência (class_ownership_transfer)
    Dest->>Sys: Aceitar
    Sys->>Sys: DB::transaction { class.owner = dest, log histórico, invite.accept() }
    Sys-->>Owner: "Turma transferida com sucesso"
```

### 2.6 Autorização por Escopo

| Camada | Mecanismo |
|--------|-----------|
| **Middleware** | `role:institution_admin\|teacher` (Spatie) |
| **Gate/Policy** | Verifica `organization_id` do usuário vs recurso |
| **TenantScope** | Global scope no Eloquent (`school_classes`, `questions`, `exams`) |
| **Perfis Extras** | Middleware custom `institution_role` que verifica `institution_role_permissions` |
| **Trash/Logs** | Middleware [can_access](file:///d:/.dev/avaliation_on/platform/tests/Feature/OMR/WebScanTest.php#41-47) verificando campos `can_access_trash/can_access_logs` na org |

### 2.7 Código de Vínculo — Geração e Busca

```php
// Geração: Alphabet sem ambíguos (I, O, 0, 1)
$alphabet = 'ABCDEFGHJKLMNPQRSTUVWXYZ23456789';
$code = '';
for ($i = 0; $i < 8; $i++) {
    $code .= $alphabet[random_int(0, strlen($alphabet) - 1)];
}
// Índice único: users.link_code (CHAR(8) UNIQUE)
// Validação: /^[A-HJ-NP-Z2-9]{8}$/
```

